  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Among the given species, $\\mathrm{Cr}^{2+}$ and $\\mathrm{Mn}^{3+}$ have same number of unpaired electrons.\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Unpaired electrons, } n=4 \\\\\n& \\text { Magnetic moment, } \\begin{aligned}\n\\mu & =\\sqrt{n(n+2)}=\\sqrt{4(4+2)} \\\\\n& =\\sqrt{24} \\mathrm{BM}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
